---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How Tangier Insider handles your data.">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: 21 November 2026</p>
  <p>Tangier Insider is a static website. It has no user accounts, no comments and no contact forms.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Hosting logs.</strong> The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may log technical data such as IP addresses to keep the service secure. See the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub privacy statement</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Emails you send us.</strong> If you email us, we use your address only to reply.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    At the moment this site sets no advertising or analytics cookies. If we add advertising or analytics in the
    future, we will update this page and ask for your consent where the law requires it.
  </p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some links may be affiliate links. When you click one, the partner site may set its own cookies under its
    own privacy policy.
  </p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us what personal data we hold about you (normally none, or only your email) and ask us to delete
    it: <a href="mailto:contact@tangierinsider.com">contact@tangierinsider.com</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
